        <detaileddescription>
<para>Unique ID indicating which driver got assigned to do the operation. Since driver contexts are driver-specific, swapping drivers halfway through the operation is not supported. ID values are auto-generated in psa_driver_wrappers.h ID value zero means the context is not valid or not assigned to any driver (i.e. none of the driver contexts are active). </para>        </detaileddescription>
